        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "To use AsciiDoc block elements, such as delimited source blocks and lists, in a column, place the lowercase letter "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "a"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " on the column specifier."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": "ex-asciidoc",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "[cols=\"2a,2\"]\n|===\n|Column with the `a` style operator applied to its specifier |Column using the default style\n\n|\n* List item 1\n* List item 2\n* List item 3\n|\n* List item 1\n* List item 2\n* List item 3\n\n|\n[source,python]\n----\nimport os\nprint \"%s\" %(os.uname())\n----\n|\n[source,python]\n----\nimport os\nprint (\"%s\" %(os.uname()))\n----\n|==="
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Apply the AsciiDoc block style operator to the first column"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The AsciiDoc block style effectively creates a nested, standalone AsciiDoc document in each cell in the column. The parent document’s implicit attributes, such as "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "doctitle"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", are shadowed and custom attributes are inherited."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
